sequenceDiagram
    participant Flutter as Flutter App
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant Scenario as Scenario Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    
    %% User Registration Flow
    Note over Flutter,DB: User Registration Flow
    Flutter->>Gateway: POST /auth/register
    Gateway->>Auth: Forward registration request
    Auth->>DB: Save user data
    DB-->>Auth: User created
    Auth->>Auth: Generate JWT token
    Auth-->>Gateway: User + JWT token
    Gateway-->>Flutter: Registration success + token
    
    %% User Login Flow
    Note over Flutter,DB: User Login Flow
    Flutter->>Gateway: POST /auth/login
    Gateway->>Auth: Forward login request
    Auth->>DB: Verify credentials
    DB-->>Auth: User data
    Auth->>Auth: Generate JWT token
    Auth-->>Gateway: Login success + token
    Gateway-->>Flutter: JWT token
    
    %% Scenario Search Flow
    Note over Flutter,DB: Scenario Search Flow
    Flutter->>Gateway: GET /scenarios/search?query=birthday
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate JWT token
    Gateway->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>Gateway: Token valid
    Gateway->>Scenario: Forward search request
    Scenario->>DB: Search scenarios
    DB-->>Scenario: Scenario results
    Scenario-->>Gateway: Search results
    Gateway-->>Flutter: Scenarios list
    
    %% Feedback Submission Flow
    Note over Flutter,DB: Feedback Submission Flow
    Flutter->>Gateway: POST /scenarios/1/feedback
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate JWT token
    Gateway->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>Gateway: Token valid + user info
    Gateway->>Scenario: Forward feedback + user ID
    Scenario->>DB: Save feedback
    DB-->>Scenario: Feedback saved
    Scenario-->>Gateway: Success response
    Gateway-->>Flutter: Feedback submitted 